# Barats, Dino Rider

> Barats is a tank jungler who only looks simple when the fight starts on his terms. He is pickable when your team can play around a slow, stack-dependent frontliner and punish one swallowed target. He is a trap when the enemy draft can kite, cleanse, or shred a giant HP bar before Detona reaches the wall.

