- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Swap when the first two enemy damage sources are physical and slows are not the reason you lose contact.; Dominance Ice over Immortality when Use against attack-speed carries, healer drafts, or shield-heavy front lines that must damage you back.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use when one burst mage can remove you before Big Guy and Thunder Belt start controlling the fight.; Radiant Armor over Immortality when Use against repeated magic ticks from heroes who chip you before objectives.
